     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageGovernance</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageGovernance\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ManageGovernance\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.PublicationManager.html\">Publication Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"GOV-01\"> </a></b>Manage shared artifact lifecycle</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can manage the lifecycle of shared artifacts (common personas, terminology, CQL libraries) across multiple SMART Guidelines IGs.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"GOV-02\"> </a></b>Coordinate concept approval</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can coordinate the approval process for new concepts being onboarded into the WHO Commons dictionary.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"GOV-03\"> </a></b>Track cross-IG dependencies</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can track and manage dependencies between IGs and shared artifact repositories.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"GOV-04\"> </a></b>Coordinate smart.who.int updates</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can coordinate with the WHO SMART Guidelines team (smart@who.int) for website updates and package list pull requests.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageGovernance</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageGovernance\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ManageGovernance\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.PublicationManager.html\">Publication Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-GOV-01\"> </a></b>Manage shared artifact lifecycle</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can manage the lifecycle of shared artifacts (common personas, terminology, CQL libraries) across multiple SMART Guidelines IGs.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-GOV-02\"> </a></b>Coordinate concept approval</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can coordinate the approval process for new concepts being onboarded into the WHO Commons dictionary.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-GOV-03\"> </a></b>Track cross-IG dependencies</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can track and manage dependencies between IGs and shared artifact repositories.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-GOV-04\"> </a></b>Coordinate smart.who.int updates</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can coordinate with the WHO SMART Guidelines team (smart@who.int) for website updates and package list pull requests.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageGovernance</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageGovernance\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ManageGovernance\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">الملف الشخصي: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>تنطبق هذه المتطلبات على الممثل <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.PublicationManager.html\">Publication Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-GOV-01\"> </a></b>Manage shared artifact lifecycle</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can manage the lifecycle of shared artifacts (common personas, terminology, CQL libraries) across multiple SMART Guidelines IGs.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-GOV-02\"> </a></b>Coordinate concept approval</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can coordinate the approval process for new concepts being onboarded into the WHO Commons dictionary.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-GOV-03\"> <